OL,3,ADemocrat Scott Colom wins Mississippi
OL,4,ASenate race in surprise victory for
OL,5,Aparty
OL,6,
OL,7,FDemocrat Scott Colom has won the US
OL,8,FSenate race in Mississippi, delivering
OL,9,Fa shock victory for the party in a
OL,10,Fdeeply conservative state that has
OL,11,Felected Republicans for decades.
OL,13,FColom's victory makes him the first
OL,14,Fblack person from Mississippi to be
OL,15,Felected to the US Senate in more than
OL,16,F140 years.
OL,18,FOnly a few thousand votes separated
OL,19,FColom from his Republican opponent, the
OL,20,Fincumbent Cindy Hyde-Smith.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
