OL,3,ADemocrat Scott Colom wins Mississippi
OL,4,ASenate race in surprise victory for
OL,5,Aparty
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe margin was so close that the race
OL,8,Fcould not be called until more than a
OL,9,Fweek after election day, as local
OL,10,Fofficials counted every single ballot
OL,11,Fthat had arrived before the deadline.
